OL,3,GNEWSASmall boat protest explained: How
OL,4,Aa Channel crossing sparked unrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of protesters gathered in
OL,7,FPortsmouth after a boat carrying about
OL,8,F140 migrants was brought ashore in
OL,9,FHampshire.
OL,11,FDemonstrators blocked roads in an
OL,12,Fattempt to stop coaches carrying the
OL,13,Fmigrants from leaving the city on
OL,14,FSunday night, following a separate
OL,15,Fprotest at the Port of Dover the
OL,16,Fprevious day.
OL,18,FHampshire Police said a small number of
OL,19,Fofficers were injured and vehicles were
OL,20,Fdamaged, with an investigation now
OL,21,Funder way to identify those
OL,22,Fresponsible.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
