OL,3,GNEWSASmall boat protest explained: How
OL,4,Aa Channel crossing sparked unrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said people had a right
OL,7,Fto peaceful protest but condemned
OL,8,F"intimidating and thuggish behaviour"
OL,9,Fat the demonstration.
